# Expense Tracker - Git Ignore File
# Prevents sensitive financial data from being committed to repository

# ==================== DATABASE FILES ====================
# CRITICAL: Never commit database files (contain financial data)
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
expense_tracker.db

